  * `react`: Rename “form state” to “action state” in `useActionState` error messages #35790
  * `react-dom`: Add support for `onFullscreenChange` and `onFullscreenError` events #34621
  * `react-dom`: Add support for the `maskType` SVG property #35921
  * `react-dom`: Support `fetchPriority` for module resources #36835
  * `react-dom`: Fire `onReset` when React automatically resets a form after a Server Action #35176
  * `react-dom`: Include the `submitter` in `submit` events #35590
  * `react-dom`: Recognize `credentialless` as a boolean attribute on iframes #36148
  * `react-dom`: Batch updates from `resize` events until the next frame #35117
  * `react-server`: Transport `Error.cause` #35810 and `AggregateError.errors` #36156 to the client
  * `react-server`: Add support for `<Activity>` in Flight #34697

Notable bug fixes

  * `react`: Fix `useDeferredValue` getting stuck on an old value #36134
  * `react`: Fix context propagation into Suspense fallbacks #36160 and through suspended Suspense boundaries #35839
  * `react`: Fix a hang when updating a dehydrated Suspense boundary inside a hidden tree #37135
  * `react`: Fix `useSyncExternalStore` missing store mutations that happened while an `<Activity>` tree was hidden #36947
  * `react`: Fix `useEffectEvent` to read the latest values in `forwardRef` and `memo` components #34831
  * `react`: Fix form status resetting when component state is updated #34075
  * `react`: Fix several Fast Refresh bugs with `lazy`, `memo`, and edits that change a component’s kind #36965, #36964, #36963, #36950
  * `react`: Fix a bug where `<title>` was still hoisted to `<head>` after the `<Activity>` containing the `<title>` changed mode from `visible` to `hidden` #34983
  * `react`: Don’t let errors escape a hidden `<Activity>` #35074
  * `react`: Hide portal contents rendered inside a hidden `<Activity>` #35091
  * `react`: Don’t reference the internal `<Offscreen>` type in error messages #35763
  * `react-dom`: Fix focus for delegated and already-focused elements #36010
  * `react-dom`: Fix a `FragmentInstance` listener leak by normalizing capture options per the DOM spec #36047
  * `react-dom`: Fix a `<ViewTransition>` crash in Mobile Safari #35337
  * `react-dom`: Fix a `<ViewTransition>` crash with `SuspenseList` #35520
  * `react-dom`: Update `defaultValue` for `type="number"` inputs to match other input types #36980
  * `react-dom`: Avoid setting `innerHTML` when it hasn’t changed #36949
  * `react-dom`: Fix a false-positive hydration mismatch on `nonce` attributes #37030
  * `react-dom`: Fix `react-dom/server` hanging on Deno #35235
  * `react-server`: Fix dropped `FormData` entries in `decodeReplyFromBusboy` #36468
  * `react-server`: Fix a stack overflow with deep async chains #35612 and a `RangeError` from exponential debug info growth #37481

For a full list of changes, please see the Changelog.

